  "question": {
    "text": "Let $[t]$ be the greatest integer less than or equal to $t$. Let $A$ be the set of all prime factors of 2310 and $f: A \\rightarrow \\mathbb{Z}$ be the function $f(x)=\\left[\\log _2\\left(x^2+\\left[\\frac{x^3}{5}\\right]\\right)\\right]$. The number of one-to-one functions from $A$ to the range of $f$ is",
    "image": null
  },
