  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{N}=2310=231 \\times 10$\n$=3 \\times 11 \\times 7 \\times 2 \\times 5$\n$A=\\{2,3,5,7,11\\}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & f(x)=\\left[\\log _2\\left(x^2+\\left[\\frac{x^3}{5}\\right]\\right)\\right] \\\\ & f(2)=\\left[\\log _2(5)\\right]=2 \\\\ & f(3)=\\left[\\log _2(14)\\right]=3 \\\\ & f(5)=\\left[\\log _2(25+25)\\right]=5 \\\\ & f(7)=\\left[\\log _2(117)\\right]=6 \\\\ & f(11)=\\left[\\log _2 387\\right]=8\\end{aligned}$\nRange of $f: B=\\{2,3,5,6,8\\}$\nNo. of one-one functions $=5 !=120$",
    "image": null
  },
